{"version":1,"content":"<p>朝中社今日（30日）報道，朝鮮於周四（29日）舉行「無人航空技術發展-2026」展覽會，展出多款戰略及作戰戰術級多用途無人機和自爆無人攻擊機等，包括各種戰術巡航飛行彈射擊、戰術自爆無人攻擊機和多用途無人機空襲，以及600毫米多管遠程火箭炮營射擊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:41:32.528389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:11:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:21.463886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:08.173329+00:00","content_hash":"ecffc4c44a7e7605d9f62b98dca4c41aa598e77ec6b1904ac9678b052803df1c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}